{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Only his burden</b> — the meaning is like: \"Did he not lift up his burden against you?\" (Numbers 23:24), for \"I will indeed lift for them\" (Numbers 24:7)." "And he mentioned להדיח — the same as כזב according to the category of הדחויה."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {1 "The relationship between להדיח and כזב is unclear; translated hyper-literally. The word הדחויה is textually uncertain in meaning."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:31.166547137Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}